      "title": "RBA interest rates live: Reserve Bank of Australia meeting today before cash rate decision and announcement – latest news",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/nov/03/rba-interest-rates-meeting-today-latest-news-australia-reserve-bank-cash-rate-announcement-decision-live-updates",
      "description": "<p>Reserve Bank raises interest rates to an 18-year high, the fifth hike this year</p><ul><li><p>Full report: <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/03/rba-interest-rates-decision-cash-rate-november-reserve-bank-australia\">RBA hikes cash rate for fifth time this year in blow to mortgage holders</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/may/04/interest-rates-rba-rate-hike-mortgage-calculator\">Use our loan calculator to check how the rate rise may affect you</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>The <strong>Reserve Bank</strong> has hiked rates for the fifth time this year, from 4.6% to 4.85%, in a bid to regain control of surging inflation amid the ongoing global oil shock triggered by the war in the Middle East.</p><p>The RBA’s decision to hit mortgage holders again comes as no surprise after inflation jumped to 4.3% in the year to September, and following tough talk from senior central bank officials over recent days and weeks.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/nov/03/rba-interest-rates-meeting-today-latest-news-australia-reserve-bank-cash-rate-announcement-decision-live-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
