    {
      "title": "RBA interest rates: Reserve Bank hikes cash rate for fifth time this year in blow to mortgage holders",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/03/rba-interest-rates-decision-cash-rate-november-reserve-bank-australia",
      "description": "<p>Reserve Bank of Australia increases official cash rate to 4.85%, bringing it to highest level since 2008</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/nov/03/rba-interest-rates-meeting-today-latest-news-australia-reserve-bank-cash-rate-announcement-decision-live-updates\">RBA interest rates live updates: Reserve Bank cash rate decision</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>The Reserve Bank has <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/nov/03/rba-interest-rates-meeting-today-latest-news-australia-reserve-bank-cash-rate-announcement-decision-live-updates\">hiked rates for the fifth time this year</a>, from 4.6% to 4.85%, in an attempt to regain control of surging inflation amid an ongoing global oil shock triggered by the war in the Middle East.</p><p>The RBA’s decision to hit mortgage holders again is no surprise after inflation jumped to 4.3% in the year to September and comes after tough talk from senior central bank officials over recent days and weeks.</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/28/politics-really-newsletter-guardian-australia-free-best-daily-auspol-email-subscribe?CMP=copyembed\">Sign up for Guardian Australia’s Politics, really newsletter here</a></strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/03/rba-interest-rates-decision-cash-rate-november-reserve-bank-australia\">Continue reading...</a>",
